  "network": "離線先讀本機(VAKE vake.duckdb v_<fn> · vdf_global_market.duckdb us_macro / parquet 鏡像);--live 才經 SUP_MDL740 雙閘 akshare_call / FRED observations;FRED 鑰只查有沒有、遮罩"
 },
